    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  啊——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "啊——"
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  那是不是整合运动发射的？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "那是不是整合运动发射的？"
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"]  ......是施加了源石技艺的弩弹。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "......是施加了源石技艺的弩弹。"
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  好烂的烟火啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "好烂的烟火啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  按临光说的，在切尔诺伯格的时候，这长鳞的小子还有着相当强的战斗力。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "按临光说的，在切尔诺伯格的时候，这长鳞的小子还有着相当强的战斗力。"
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  她说那时候她的胳膊都差点被打断，凭我对这个女人的了解，至少我肯定是打不断的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "她说那时候她的胳膊都差点被打断，凭我对这个女人的了解，至少我肯定是打不断的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  但刚才我只觉得他的弦已经完了，弩弹里也没剩下多少法术。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "但刚才我只觉得他的弦已经完了，弩弹里也没剩下多少法术。"
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  怎么回事啊，臭小子。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "怎么回事啊，臭小子。"
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"]  我想，他可能......没有理由再战斗下去了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "我想，他可能......没有理由再战斗下去了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  我说，阿米娅，有没有他用法术避过了攻击的可能性？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "我说，阿米娅，有没有他用法术避过了攻击的可能性？"
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"]  ......抱歉。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[name=\"煌\"]  道什么歉啊。我只是可惜那个小子。凭我一眼看穿人的本事看，他不坏。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "煌",
        "content": "道什么歉啊。我只是可惜那个小子。凭我一眼看穿人的本事看，他不坏。"
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[name=\"灰喉\"]  现在说什么都太晚了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "灰喉",
        "content": "现在说什么都太晚了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"]  并不晚。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "并不晚。"
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"]  过去埋下的悲剧，现在开花结果......而未来的悲剧，我们还有能力去阻止。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "过去埋下的悲剧，现在开花结果......而未来的悲剧，我们还有能力去阻止。"
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[name=\"灰喉\"]  ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "灰喉",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[name=\"灰喉\"]  我去回收他的弩。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "灰喉",
        "content": "我去回收他的弩。"
    },
